  "instructions": [
    "Bring the coconut milk and water to a simmer in a medium pot.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, minced garlic, minced ginger, sliced chili, and cajun seasoning to the broth and stir until the aromatics are fragrant.",
    "Place the rice noodles in the simmering broth, then cover and cook for 3 to 4 minutes until they soften.",
    "Drain the noodles and arrange them into small boat shapes on a plate, securing with a toothpick if needed.",
    "In a small bowl, melt the tempered dark chocolate with a splash of coconut milk until glossy.",
    "Toss the cooked noodles in the broth, then drizzle the chocolate sauce over each boat and garnish with basil, cilantro, peanuts, and scallions."
